WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.771
Step 1. Open the activity definition.

1.2
00:00:02.771 --> 00:00:07.130
In Settings, in the Clinical group, select Activity Definitions,

1.3
00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:15.027
and open the category that holds it. Then select View on the activity definition.

2.1
00:00:15.027 --> 00:00:17.138
Step 2. Update the details.

2.2
00:00:17.138 --> 00:00:21.412
Select Edit, change the fields that you need, and select Save.

2.3
00:00:21.412 --> 00:00:33.246
Care does not change the Slug when you change the Title.

3.1
00:00:33.246 --> 00:00:38.238
Step 3. Retire the activity definition. Select Delete, then Confirm.

3.2
00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:42.840
Care sets the status to Retired and keeps the activity definition,

3.3
00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.060
and the order form no longer offers it.

4.1
00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:50.296
Step 4. Make a retired activity definition active again.

4.2
00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:55.136
Set the Status filter to Retired, select Edit, set Status to Active,

4.3
00:00:55.136 --> 00:01:10.544
and select Save. It shows in the order form again.
